                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "UUID of the canonical pair quoted against USD (e.g. BTC-USD). Pass in the currency_pair_ids array to add_to_watchlist / remove_from_watchlist. For current price call get_crypto_quotes with the pair SYMBOL (construct as currency.code + \"-USD\"), not this UUID. Empty when no such pair exists for this asset (rare)."
