sponses; optional on run_scan."},"cortex_managed":{"type":"boolean","description":"True when this scan was created or modified by Cortex. Read-only via MCP tools."}},"description":"The scan after the update, plus fresh live results matching the new filter set.","required":["scan_id","scan_title","total_items","results","cortex_managed"],"additionalProperties":false}},"description":"Tool-specific result payload; see the inner properties for fields.","required":["result"],"additionalProperties":false},"guide":{"type":"string","description":"How to interpret the response:
