        "contract": {
          "name": "get_equity_tax_lots",
          "title": null,
          "description": "List the open tax lots for one equity holding in an account — each lot is a separate acquisition with its own quantity, cost basis, acquisition date, and long/short-term status. Requires a symbol (tax lots are tracked per instrument). Use it for cost-basis, holding-period, or which-lots-would-sell questions.",
