},"category":null,"arguments":{},"result":{},"reason":"News is outside this broker profile’s scope.","warnings":[],"original":{"name":"get_equity_news","category":null,"arguments":{},"result":{},"reason":"News is outside this broker profile’s scope.","warnings":[]},"edits":[]},"get_equity_orders":{"contract":{"name":"get_equity_orders","title":null,"description":"Fetch equity orders for an account — list mode (newest first; open and closed, including fills, cancellations, rejections) or single-order mode by passing order_id. When the user asks for "orders" without specifying an asset class, call get_equity_orders, get_option_orders, and get_advanced_orders (OCO / multi-leg contingency orders) in parallel.

Filtering tips:
- Prefer narrow queries: combine state, symbol, and/or created_at_gte for specific questions (e.g. "my filled AAPL orders this week") — the per-page cap is fixed.
