 through this channel. No value is ever returned for these. Absent when none were requested."}},"description":"Tool-specific result payload; see the inner properties for fields.","required":["indexes"],"additionalProperties":false},"guide":{"type":"string","description":"Each indexes[] entry identifies one index by id and symbol. current_value is a snapshot — for live values, pass id to get_index_quotes. Entries under restricted have no values available through this channel — relay their message to the user verbatim; do not retry or estimate a value."}},"required":["data","guide"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true},"execution":null,"shape_hash":"sha256:377d10b3c54516082b1616696dacff642f3c1289f5cb4613aed351b9348924c2","contract_hash":"sha256:4323fa973ff087097f0d13a7a67b2f61b4562a0d83edc8fef6ab02461f934a34"},"category":null,"arguments":{},"result":{},"reason":"Market indexes are outside this broker profile’s scope.","warnings":[],"original":{"name":"get_indexes","category":null,"arguments":{},"result":{},"reason":"Market indexes are outside this broker profile’s scope.","warnings":[]},"edits":[]},"get_limited_margin_upgrade_info":{"contract":{"name":"get_limited_margin_upgrade_info","title":null,"description":"Check whether a cash account is eligible to upgrade to limited margin and return the links (web and mobile) that start the upgrade flow. Limited margin lets the account trade with unsettled funds — proceeds from a sale can go into a new order before that sale settles — while adding no borrowing or leverage. Call when the user asks about that capability, about trading with unsettled funds, or about enabling limited margin — or when a cash account shows unsettled_funds greater than 0 while you are reporting its funds, value, or buying power (the get_accounts and get_portfolio guides direct this)..","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"account_number":{"type":"string","description":"Brokerage account number to check. Obtain 