"type":"string","description":"Currency of the amount, e.g. 'USD'. Omitted when the upstream did not specify one."}},"description":"Trailing offset as a dollar amount; present when peg_type is 'price'.","required":["amount"],"additionalProperties":false},"percentage_peg":{"type":"string","description":"Trailing offset as a percentage (decimal string); present when peg_type is 'percentage'."},"symbol":{"type":"string","description":"Ticker symbol of the tradable, e.g. 'AAPL' for an equity or option underlying, or 'BTC-USD' for crypto."},"strike_price":{"type":["null","object"],"properties":{"amount":{"type":"string","description":"Decimal monetary amount as a string, e.g. '150.25'. Not a number, to avoid float rounding."},"currency_code":{"type":"string","description":"Currency of the amount, e.g. 'USD'. Omitted when the upstream did not specify one."}},"description":"Option strike price; present only for option orders.","required":["amount"],"additionalProperties":false},"expiration_date":{"type":"string","description":"Option expiration date as 'YYYY-MM-DD'; present only for option orders."},"option_type":{"type":"string","description":"Option contract type, 'call' or 'put'; present only for option orders."},"position_effect":{"type":"string","description":"Whether the option order opens or closes a position, e.g. 'open', 'close', 'roll'; present only for option orders."},"estimated_cost":{"type":["null","object"],"properties":{"amount":{"type":"string","description":"Decimal monetary amount as a string, e.g. '150.25'. Not a number, to avoid float rounding."},"currency_code":{"type":"string","description":"Currency of the amount, e.g. 'USD'. Omitted when the upstream did not specify one."}},"description":"Estimated total debit (cost) of the order. Mutually exclusive with estimated_credit.","required":["amount"],"additionalProperties":false},"estimated_credit":{"type":["null","object"],"properties":{"amount":{"type":"string","description":"Decimal monetary amount as a string, e.g. '150.25'. Not a number, to avoid float rounding."},"currency_code":{"type":"string","description":"Currency of the amount, e.g. 'USD'. Omitted when the upstream did not specify one."}},"description":"Estimated total credit (proceeds) of the order. Mutually exclusive with estimated_cost.","required":["amount"],"additionalProperties":false},"estimated_quantity":{"type":"string","description":"Estimated fill quantity as a decimal string, when the order is sized in dollars."},"tax_lot_selection_type":{"type":"string","description":"Tax-lot disposal method for a specified-lot sell, e.g. 'custom'. Omitted when the order uses the default (FIFO), and never populated on actual_order."},"tax_lots":{"type":["null","array"],"items":{"type":"object","properties":{"open_lot_id":{"type":"string","description":"UUID of the open tax lot being sold."},"quantity":{"type":"string","description":"Shares sold from this lot as a decimal string."}},"required":["open_lot_id","quantity"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"The specific open lots to sell; present only for a specified-lot (custom) sell. Never populated on actual_order, regardless of the placed order's lot selection."}},"description":"The reconciled order actually placed; present only when is_edited is true.","required":["asset_class","side","order_type","time_in_force","trigger"],"additionalProperties":false},"expires_at":{"type":"string","description":"RFC3339 timestamp of when this pending approval expires."},"created_at":{"type":"string","description":"RFC3339 timestamp of when this approval was created."},"updated_at":{"type":"string","description":"RFC3339 timestamp of when this approval was last updated."}},"description":"Present only when the account requires the customer's approval before agent-placed trades execute: the order was NOT placed. Read approval.state — APPROVAL_STATE_PENDING is awaiting the customer's decision in the Robinhood app; a terminal state (e.g. APPROVAL_STATE_DECLINED, APPROVAL_STATE_EXPIRED) means this ref_id's earlier approval is already resolved. Never present otherwise.","required":["approval_id","account_number","asset_class","state","is_edited"],"additionalProperties":false}},"description":"Tool-specific result payload; see the inner properties for fields.","additionalProperties":false},"guide":{"type":"string","description":"The order has been submitted — not necessarily filled. Describe it with state. Tell the user the order was placed, summarize side, type (ALWAYS the app's name: stop_loss = "stop order", stop_limit = "stop limit order" — never show the raw values to the user), quantity (or dollar amount) phrased as an amount of the asset (e.g. '0.001542 ETH') and never as 'shares', any limit/stop prices, and the estimated fee — from estimated_fee, shown even when 0, with the fee_rate value appended verbatim in parentheses when present, e.g. '$1.23 (0.5% maker)' or '$1.23 (0.35%)', or the fee_context value appended verbatim in parentheses when fee_rate is absent and fee_context is present, e.g. '$0 (asset not eligible for fee tiers)' (never re-derive, re-label, or reword either parenthetical; none when both are absent). When tax_withholding is present, give the backup withholding as its own line in the confirmation: show whichever of tax_withholding.estimated_withholding_amount / total_withholding_amount is present (exactly one ever is), labeled "Estimated backup withholding" for the estimate and "Backup withholding" for the total, with the tax_withholding.withholding_rate value appended verbatim in parentheses, e.g. 'Estimated backup withholding: $23.88 (24%)'; never mention withholding when tax_withholding is absent. State the total from whichever net_* field the order carries — labeled estimated for net_rounded_estimated_notional, final (or "so far" while cumulative_quantity is below quantity) for net_rounded_executed_notional — never from rounded_estimated_notional_with_estimated_fee, which is net of the fee only and will overstate a withholding-subject sell; if neither net total is present, give no total figure. Remind them it may not have filled yet and can be checked or canceled via id. For orders entered by dollar_amount, quantity is derived at placement — from the live quote for market orders (a buy is sized at the market price like the app: debit typically ~the dollar_amount, worst case up to ~1% more; a sell likewise sized at the market price: credit typically ~the dollar_amount, worst case up to ~5% less), from the stop price for stop_loss orders (typical fill notional ~the dollar_amount, worst case up to the collar worse), from the limit price for limit and stop limit orders. For market and stop_loss present the derived quantity as estimated until the order fills; for limit and stop_limit the derived quantity is exact at placement and a buy's total is capped at the requested amount. On fee-priced accounts a sell's fee is deducted from the credit. For orders entered by quantity, the amount is exact. Identify the account by the crypto_account_number returned in the response, not by the brokerage account number the tool was called with. On error, the order was NOT placed — report the error verbatim."}},"required":["data","guide"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":null,"execution":null,"shape_hash":"sha256:d542bfb7b4e74abde45ad1f0fa8cde1e2a588a957fea0516d4eb18f506812263","contract_hash":"sha256:85a7ebdc8fbf85da47c920a9bddb8f73c4ec145fe154b442180dcd7dbbd5ef7b"},"category":null,"arguments":{},"result":{},"reason":"Crypto orders are outside this broker profile’s scope.","warnings":[],"original":{"name":"place_crypto_order","category":null,"arguments":{},"result":{},"reason":"Crypto orders are outside this broker profile’s scope.","warnings":[]},"edits":[]},"place_equity_order":{"contract":{"name":"place_equity_order","title":null,"description":"Place a real equity order with real money. Parameters mirror review_equity_order plus the optional ref_id. Requires an agentic_allowed=true account; non-agentic accounts are rejected — do not call.

Workflow: by default call review_equity_order first, present the estimated cost and any alerts, and get explicit user confirmation before calling this tool. Skip review only when the user has very explicitly asked to bypass it (e.g. "skip the review", "just place it, don't review") — a generic "place this order" is NOT a bypass.

Idempotency: pass a fresh UUID as ref_id on the first call for each logical order, and re-send the SAME ref_id on retries of transient transport failures. Use a new ref_id only when the user wants a new order.

Parameter rules:
- If the user has not specified type, ask. For immediate fills with price protection, prefer a marketable limit at the current ask over a plain market.
- Outside regular hours, only limit orders execute. For an immediate fill during extended or overnight/24-hour sessions, place a limit order (a marketable limit at the current ask) with market_hours set to that session — not a market order. Market and stop orders are regular_hours-only; placed after hours as regular_hours they queue for the next regular open.
- Provide exactly one of quantity or dollar_amount; dollar_amount requires type=market (server computes shares from last_trade_price).
- Fractional shares: only on type=market with market_hours=regular_hours, eligible accounts, up to 6 decimal places, no short sells.
- limit_price required for limit/stop_limit; stop_price required for stop_market/stop_limit.
- Fractional and dollar-based orders only place in regular_hours; the tool rejects them in other sessions.
- tax_lots (specified-lot selling, sell only): to sell specific lots, first call get_equity_tax_lots for the symbol, then pass tax_lots as {open_lot_id, quantity} pairs whose quantities sum to the order quantity. Omit for default (FIFO) cost basis. US accounts only; not allowed with dollar_amount, stop orders, all_day_hours, or fractional limit orders.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"account_number":{"type":"string","description":"Brokerage account number. Must come from the user or be clearly implied — never default from get_accounts. Must be agentic_allowed=true; non-agentic accounts are rejected."},"symbol":{"type":"string","description":"Stock symbol."},"side":{"type":"string","description":"'buy' or 'sell'."},"type":{"type":"string","description":"'market', 'limit', 'stop_market', or 'stop_limit'."},"quantity":{"type":"string","description":"Number of shares. Decimals (fractional) allowed for market + regular_hours only."},"dollar_amount":{"type":"string","description":"USD notional (e.g. '100.00'). Only valid with type=market."},"limit_price":{"type":"string","description":"Limit price; required for limit or stop_limit."},"stop_price":{"type":"string","description":"Stop trigger price; required for stop_market or stop_limit."},"time_in_force":{"type":"string","description":"'gfd' or 'gtc'. Default: gfd."},"market_hours":{"type":"string","description":"'regular_hours' (default, 9:30–16:00 ET), 'extended_hours' (pre-/post-market), or 'all_day_hours' (the 24 Hour Market / overnight session). extended_hours and all_day_hours execute limit orders only — market, stop_market, and stop_limit are regular_hours-only and are rejected if tagged to another session."},"tax_lots":{"type":["null","array"],"items":{"type":"object","properties":{"open_lot_id":{"type":"string","description":"open_lot_id of the open tax lot to sell, from get_equity_tax_lots."},"quantity":{"type":"string","description":"Shares to sell from this lot as a decimal string; at most the 